<title>HONG KONG: DICKSON SAYS EXPECTS ST DUPONT PRICE AT 168-196 FFR PER SHARE.</title>
<headline>DICKSON SAYS EXPECTS ST DUPONT PRICE AT 168-196 FFR PER SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ST Dupont, a wholly owned subsidiary of Hong Kong retailer Dickson Concepts, on Wednesday announced details of the proposed global sale of its shares.</p>
<p>The offer price is expected to be between 168 and 196 French francs per share, the company said</p>
<p>The actual offer price will be announced on December 4, it said.</p>
<p>Dickson said last week ST Dupont would be listed on the Paris stock exchange.</p>
</text>
